  "headline": "President Prabowo Begins Process To Select New Vice President",
  "seoTitle": "Prabowo Begins Selection Process For New Vice President",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto has initiated the search for a new vice president, with political parties currently deliberating on potential candidates.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto is soliciting nominations for a new vice president following the vacancy left by Gibran Rakabuming Raka.",
    "Political parties including Golkar and PDIP are currently evaluating potential candidates as the president reviews the succession.",
    "The president has indicated that the final selection process will continue following his return from official trips to Manila and Shenzhen."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "Following the vacancy of the vice presidential position, President Prabowo Subianto has begun the formal process of identifying a successor. The president has requested that coalition partners and relevant parties submit potential candidates, providing them with a one-week timeframe to finalize their suggestions. While various figures have been mentioned in public discussions and media reports—including members of the DPD RI, Puan Maharani, and Pramono Anung—political organizations like PKS have stated they are not proposing names, opting instead to respect the prerogative of the coalition parties. The president, who has emphasized the lack of time for rest, noted that the final decision remains under consideration as he manages his international itinerary. The selection remains a central topic of discourse among political elites in Indonesia as the administration looks to resolve the leadership gap.",
